Package: libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-dev
Version: @DEB_LIBGDKPIXBUF_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gdk-pixbuf
Depends: libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0 (= @DEB_LIBGDKPIXBUF_V@), libglib2.0-dev, libpng16-dev, libjpeg62-turbo-dev, libtiff-dev
Description: Development files for the GDK Pixbuf library
 The GDK Pixbuf library provides image loading, scaling and rendering
 facilities used by GTK and other GNOME applications.
 .
 This package contains the development headers, symlinks, pkg-config files and
 tools needed to build software that uses GDK Pixbuf.
